either as an Article, Paragraph, Subparagraph, or within the text.  If this 
is not done, the paragraph number for that item will not print on the Submittal 
Register.</ITA></NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR><ITA>Submittal classifications are only referenced in the Submittal Article.  Insert 
